{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04TJ", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1af96357bb9f98988796ecd0a67818df048aaebb68aa3d24da71bd8b1419861d", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nHere is the main result of this section.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4ef350cf0b719d60ff07db045ca6fcb65ff81385def9018e9db476c9e33165e6", "unit_id": "tag:04TJ:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "theorem", "parent_tag": "04TJ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0004": "$S$", "MATH_0005": "$[U/R]$", "MATH_0006": "$S$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{theorem}\n\\label{theorem-smooth-groupoid-gives-algebraic-stack}\n", "suffix": "\\end{theorem}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:afdae36ccb13e45f17ab4a3e76e67ca86369c82850b4a1f8ea24b752c0da3381", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:01231c04e62f37e8b2953c0f13a3df798693a45c5d979906b1459a47dcbe2dfb", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme contained in <MATH_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0003> be a smooth groupoid in algebraic spaces over <MATH_0004>.\nThen the quotient stack <MATH_0005> is an algebraic stack over <MATH_0006>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7c8b2ad61d071b7d8b40f859a5a9acbce41299eb79eee8cec94b9e96de1c985e", "unit_id": "tag:04TK:statement"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04TJ", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0002": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$[U/R]$", "MATH_0002": "$W$", "MATH_0003": "$S$", "MATH_0004": "$1$", "MATH_0005": "$(\\Sch/W)_{fppf} \\longrightarrow \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0006": "$W \\in \\Ob((\\Sch/S)_{fppf})$", "MATH_0007": "$W \\to U$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{S}_W \\to \\mathcal{S}_U$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{S}_W \\to \\mathcal{S}_U$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{S}_W \\to \\mathcal{S}_U \\to [U/R]$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-algebraic-stack}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-diagonal-quotient-stack}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-map-presheaves-representable-by-spaces-transformation-property}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-representable-transformations-property-implication}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{lemma-smooth-quotient-smooth-presentation}", "REF_0006": "\\ref{lemma-composition-representable-transformations-property}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0002": "\\noindent", "STRUCT_0003": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0004": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:f2b6192662ef2608f9a91fabf7377d494c23ac524b54133f31f4c5ead057d39c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e7bbe27224fa914c0096635241f528f3c28181fcd698a374f02c57472ab40daa", "source_text": "We check the three conditions of\nDefinition <REF_0001>.\nBy construction we have that <MATH_0001> is a stack in groupoids\nwhich is the first condition.\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\nThe second condition follows from the stronger\nLemma <REF_0002>.\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\nFinally, we have to show there exists a scheme <MATH_0002> over <MATH_0003>\nand a surjective smooth <MATH_0004>-morphism\n<MATH_0005>.\nFirst choose <MATH_0006> and a\nsurjective <ACCENT_0001>tale morphism <MATH_0007>. Note that this\ngives a surjective <ACCENT_0002>tale morphism <MATH_0008>\nof categories fibred in sets, see\nLemma\n<REF_0003>.\nOf course then <MATH_0009> is also surjective and\nsmooth, see\nLemma <REF_0004>.\nHence <MATH_0010> is surjective\nand smooth by a combination of\nLemmas <REF_0005> and\n<REF_0006>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a9fa7842bfd3ae6ea487a8edb18d046d789fc31a5603780e072289d736013107", "unit_id": "tag:04TK:proof"}
